<title>MALAYSIA: Perfect Food suspended at firm's request.</title>
<headline>Perfect Food suspended at firm's request.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Perfect Food Industries Bhd were suspended in early Monday trading at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock was last traded at 12.30 ringgit, up 40 cents. It earlier rose to a year-high of 12.40. Perfect Food makes and distributes foodstuffs and is also involved in property development.  </p>
<p>Officials at the company could not be immediately contacted for comment.</p>
<p>Perfect Food is listed on the second board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
